/// known-gap: interp lets `self >> f |=` rebind a readonly field inside a method
/// A method cannot rebind a readonly field of its object either.
<>Hero |
    name!: "x"
    hp: 10
    act rename(n)
        self >> name |= n
    xx
xx
h <> Hero | name: "Ann"
say("before")
h.rename("Bob")
say(h >> name)
